| Part of the repository | Licence |
| --- | --- |
| Code, components and build tools: `site/` (HTML, CSS, JavaScript), `scripts/`, `tests/`, `schema/`, and configuration files such as `netlify.toml` | MIT License (Part 1) |
| Written content, data and diagrams: `data/` (things, views, categories, checkpoints and their text), `docs/`, every Markdown file (`*.md`), and diagrams wherever they are kept | CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (Part 2) |

When a file is not named above, code is under Part 1 and prose or data is
under Part 2.

Third-party media keep their own licences and are not covered by either part:
images hot-linked from Wikimedia Commons (each one's author, licence and
Commons page are recorded beside it in `data/`) and the icons in
`data/media/icons/` (see `data/media/icons/README.md`).


